<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai to issue 10 bln bht debentures.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai to issue 10 bln bht debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krung Thai Bank Plc said on Wednesday it would issue unsecured debentures worth up to 10 billion baht ($385 million) for overseas investors.</p>
</text>
